1
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Help you, ma'am?

2
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,900
Good morning, Sergeant.

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,600
I'm here to report for duty.

4
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,700
Toy-store badge. Try again.

5
00:00:27,458 --> 00:00:29,058
My name is Nora Hale.

6
00:00:29,058 --> 00:00:30,758
Today is my first day.

7
00:00:39,458 --> 00:00:40,858
Fake papers too.

8
00:00:40,858 --> 00:00:42,758
You people will try anything.

9
00:00:52,058 --> 00:00:53,558
Three seconds.

10
00:00:53,558 --> 00:00:55,758
Then you're under arrest.

11
00:00:59,717 --> 00:01:01,517
Call Lieutenant Commander Reed.

12
00:01:01,517 --> 00:01:02,317
Right now.

13
00:01:08,975 --> 00:01:10,875
Good morning, Chief Hale.

14
00:01:17,375 --> 00:01:18,875
Sergeant. Your badge.

15
00:01:18,875 --> 00:01:20,375
On the counter.
